{"ID":"20240118144952-vhs0qid","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144952-vhs0qid","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144952-vhs0qid\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144952-dq7u03y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170759-6vze6uy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170759-6vze6uy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:268,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:268\u0026#125;","title":"379补22木通（通草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204170618"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144952-dq7u03y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144952-dq7u03y","updated":"20240122170728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】木通古名通草，多自生山野，庭园亦可栽植，各省有之，茎入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170731-sdm6o7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170731-sdm6o7q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛苦（或作辛甘）性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170733-vvk0hjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170733-vvk0hjx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】木通为导湿热，利小便要药，主降心火，清肺热，化津液，止大渴，治淋沥，水肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170734-b5obz01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170734-b5obz01"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗脾疽常欲眠，心烦哕，出音声，治耳聋，散痈肿诸结不消，及金疮恶疮，鼠瘘踒折，齆鼻息肉，堕胎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170736-2javx5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170736-2javx5b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治五淋，利小便，开关格，治人多唾，主水肿浮大。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170738-848j8sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170738-848j8sk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】利诸经脉寒热不通之气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170739-c7dt6sn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170739-c7dt6sn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【士良】理风热小便数急痛，小腹虚满，宜煎汤并葱饮有效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170740-01w4j3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170740-01w4j3f"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】安心除烦，止渴退热，明耳目，治鼻塞。通小肠下水，破积聚血块，排脓，治疮疖，止痛推生下胞，女人血闭，月候不匀，天行时疾，头痛目眩；羸劣，乳结，下乳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170744-se14coe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170744-se14coe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】利大小便，令人心宽下气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170746-absvj30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170746-absvj30"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【李珣】主诸痿疮，喉痹咽痛，浓煎含咽。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170747-dge54zo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170747-dge54zo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【冬垣】通经利窍，导小肠火。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170748-jpdfbvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170748-jpdfbvr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通七分至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170749-d8lpe3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170749-d8lpe3h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡精滑不梦自遗，及阳虚气弱，内无湿热者忌，孕妇禁用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170721-9eq0vd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170721-9eq0vd0","updated":"20240122170727"}},{"ID":"20240122170750-h43egqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170750-h43egqs"}},{"ID":"20240122170750-o9wxyk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170750-o9wxyk8","updated":"20240204170501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第22木通。诸位看这是郁金，这是木通。哦你看这木通象车轮一样，哦车轮一样，郁金和木通。这个木通呢，过去我们称为通草，它的味道是辛苦性平，木通是导湿热，利小便的药，所以一般来说我们治水肿的时候，我们会使用到木通，木通，那腹水、肝硬化、积水的时候常常会这个木通也会用到。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170759-6vze6uy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170759-6vze6uy","updated":"20240204170618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别录】说专门治疗脾疽常欲眠，心烦哕，那小便不利是最主要的，【甄权】呢你看水肿浮大。所以木通是利小便的药。那张仲景呢也有使用到木通，这个【孟铣】呢他说利诸经脉寒热不通之气。张仲景用做通脉当归四逆汤里面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归四逆汤里面就是手脚冰冷，加木通的意思就是让它气能够通到所有的经脉上去，木通象车轮一样，所以它能够通关活络效果非常的好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。【大明】呢它说安心除烦，止渴退热，最后它写乳结，下乳。乳房呢奶水硬在那边，堵在那边出不来，乳房有硬块哦，出不来，我们可以用木通，来清它，木通也是很好使用的一个药，那一般来说的话，这个木通质很轻，诸位看它是质很轻的东西啊，一般开二钱，哦二钱都很多了，一钱两钱就够了。"}]}]}